# Pin JSON files to LF line endings in the index regardless of platform.
# Without this, Windows working trees can commit CRLF-stored JSON that
# then mismatches the LF-stored version on Linux CI checkouts. The
# detection-quality workflow surfaced this trap; pinning here removes
# the failure mode at the source. The byte-identity workflow's runtime
# LF normalization stays as defense-in-depth.
*.json text eol=lf
